{"code":0,"msg":"","data":{"music":{"meta":{"prompt":"我想创作一首歌曲，用${musicGenaration_lyricGenaration}。这首歌是${musicGenaration_genre}音乐风格，传达${musicGenaration_mood}的情绪，使用${musicGenaration_gender} 音色。","option_list":[{"type":3,"value":"musicGenaration_gender","show_name":"","options":[{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},{"show_name":"女声","value":"Female","is_default":true}]},{"type":3,"value":"musicGenaration_genre","show_name":"","options":[{"show_name":"流行","value":"Pop","is_default":true},{"show_name":"嘻哈","value":"Hip Hop/Rap","is_default":false},{"show_name":"国风","value":"Chinese Style","is_default":false},{"show_name":"DJ","value":"DJ","is_default":false},{"show_name":"摇滚","value":"Rock","is_default":false},{"show_name":"民谣","value":"Folk","is_default":false},{"show_name":"R\u0026B","value":"R\u0026B/Soul","is_default":false},{"show_name":"雷鬼","value":"Reggae","is_default":false},{"show_name":"朋克","value":"Punk","is_default":false},{"show_name":"电音","value":"Electronic","is_default":false},{"show_name":"爵士","value":"Jazz","is_default":false}]},{"type":3,"value":"musicGenaration_lyricGenaration","show_name":"","options":[{"show_name":"AI 帮我写歌词","value":"AI_lyric","is_default":true,"after_key":"musicGenaration_AI_lyric"},{"show_name":"自定义歌词","value":"custome_lyric","is_default":false,"after_key":"musicGenaration_custom_lyric"}]},{"type":3,"value":"musicGenaration_mood","show_name":"","options":[{"show_name":"快乐","value":"Happy","is_default":true},{"show_name":"放松","value":"Chill","is_default":false},{"show_name":"活力","value":"Dynamic/Energetic","is_default":false},{"show_name":"兴奋","value":"Excited","is_default":false},{"show_name":"忧郁","value":"Sentimental/Melancholic/Lonely","is_default":false},{"show_name":"鼓舞","value":"Inspirational/Hopeful","is_default":false},{"show_name":"伤感","value":"Sorrow/Sad","is_default":false},{"show_name":"怀旧","value":"Nostalgic/Memory","is_default":false},{"show_name":"浪漫","value":"Romantic","is_default":false}]},{"type":1,"value":"musicGenaration_AI_lyric","show_name":"","placeholder":{"placeholder":"[描述歌词要表达的主题]","default_text":""}},{"type":4,"value":"musicGenaration_custom_lyric","show_name":"","click_area":{"first_few_words":"","fill_text":"","default_text":"[点击输入自定义歌词]"}}]},"template":{"music_list":[{"title":"醒来","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/30d7e20bc75842199870692140785459.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/30d7e20bc75842199870692140785459.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"摇滚","value":"Rock","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"放松","value":"Chill","is_default":false},"lyric":"提线木偶般扭动四肢把自己叫醒在清晨\n眼神在五光十色的屏幕前聚焦又涣散\n划过精心包装的视频 掉进虚幻失真的世界\n你在里面嬉笑怒骂 脸孔变换\n曾经大言不惭的梦想还记得吗 \n不如冲破这茧房跃入山川湖海的怀抱\n狂奔向苍穹去寻找许巍歌里的蓝莲花\n让自由肆意主宰 你也终将野蛮生长","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#26222a"},{"title":"关于你","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/8021b6c17f824df181d2a6c87c2059bf.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/8021b6c17f824df181d2a6c87c2059bf.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"民谣","value":"Folk","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"忧郁","value":"Sentimental/Melancholic/Lonely","is_default":false},"lyric":"你是天边揉碎的白云 轻盈啊\n你是擦肩落下的细雨 醉人啊\n你是高悬天空的明月 遥远啊\n我在夜里寂静 你在眼底蔓延\n我多想 轻握着你的手\n告诉你我所有最深沉的忧愁\n告诉你我的秘密我的温柔\n能否允许我 再陪你走过山高水长","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"女声","value":"Female","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#153a79"},{"title":"玉碎银鞍","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/35035427a8674ce2ad738efa4158ab85.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/35035427a8674ce2ad738efa4158ab85.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"国风","value":"Chinese Style","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"伤感","value":"Sorrow/Sad","is_default":false},"lyric":"往事如烟 何日重现\n燃尽大殿 天人相隔不复见\n银鞍白马 断弦琵琶\n此生永别玉兰花\n泥沼深陷 万丈深渊\n半生飘摇 恨意涛涛\n刀山火海走一遭 幽冥地狱催人老\n谁将故人悼","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"女声","value":"Female","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#273436"},{"title":"漫漫","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/64b77af6ff0b4c2ba69a1377710ca63d.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/64b77af6ff0b4c2ba69a1377710ca63d.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"R\u0026B","value":"R\u0026B/Soul","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"放松","value":"Chill","is_default":false},"lyric":"漫漫 怎么让我遇到了你\n好巧你也爱在湖边看下雨\n看行人走走停停 \n我们算不算是心有灵犀\n人生一直漫漫慢慢\n漫无目的地将你装在眼底\n慢慢我已离不开你\n慢慢我们一起变老下去","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#166a7b"},{"title":"在全宇宙与你相遇","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/e51b686a4ffc4830a2fb50fcabe736d1.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/e51b686a4ffc4830a2fb50fcabe736d1.mp3","genre":{"show_name":"摇滚","value":"Rock","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"放松","value":"Chill","is_default":false},"lyric":"如戏般的剧本无聊的探索\n宇宙的边缘是未知的轮廓\n人们的生活是否有所掩饰\n灵魂之外还有无尽的渴求\n浩瀚 孤寂 波光粼粼\n和你互相辉映\n捍卫 不朽 这样足够\n还好有你懂我","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#192634"},{"title":"牙买加的偶遇","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/a57af2c6669c40b5aa00e361525101bd.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/a57af2c6669c40b5aa00e361525101bd.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"雷鬼","value":"Reggae","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"活力","value":"Dynamic/Energetic","is_default":false},"lyric":"我绕着加勒比海 来到牙买加\n快乐如同棕榈叶 随海风飘动\n偶遇了海边老人 却没有聊天\n他说不要再回头看 你也可以奔跑起来\nStand up hurry up\nRun up fly up\n我沿着海风飘啊飘啊 就算双脚打结也不累\n我看着浪潮翻啊翻啊 感受这无尽自由时间","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#174c82"},{"title":"爱的具象化","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/e9b97c1a6ab147d785bc9462d529fa6b.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/e9b97c1a6ab147d785bc9462d529fa6b.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"流行","value":"Pop","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"快乐","value":"Happy","is_default":false},"lyric":"咖啡香氤氲了晨曦的窗 你在身旁陪我翻阅着时光\n细雨轻敲温柔乡 我们的心跳合奏同频的交响\n午后阳光洒落 捧一束浪漫与你对坐\n街灯下影子交错 爱人啊再把那情话轻讲\n爱的具象化 是漫步宇宙却发现你比星辰明亮\n是化身仓颉 也造不出你名字的分量\n是你看宏大的意象 无法写好爱的具象\n就像我爱你这件事 早已成为我生命的征象","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"女声","value":"Female","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#823e17"},{"title":"戏中梦","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/f1f9fdd35bc04d45902b6493a19f0ecc.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/f1f9fdd35bc04d45902b6493a19f0ecc.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"国风","value":"Chinese Style","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"忧郁","value":"Sentimental/Melancholic/Lonely","is_default":false},"lyric":"梦是虚实的界限 跨越时间一步千年\n那时笔墨还未染史篇 你仍是少年\n你英年魂归 我迟生千年难吊唁\n骤然清醒 前尘皆散独坐镜前描妆勾面\n金戈铁马吞山河 封狼居胥凯歌旋\n我在台上将戏演 你唯剩史书字里行间\n我唱云遮月 扮将军当年风光无限\n一戏唱罢英雄事 只憾今生前尘无缘相见","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"女声","value":"Female","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#765523"},{"title":"凤梨罐头","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/96309b9d45774cbca2fd96fd519f1df0.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/96309b9d45774cbca2fd96fd519f1df0.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"爵士","value":"Jazz","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"怀旧","value":"Nostalgic/Memory","is_default":false},"lyric":"我打开那瓶凤梨罐头 才发现它已过了期\n尝一口过期的希望 酸苦肆意侵袭\n寂静的夜里回忆如潮涌 心却在游离\n从一数到五百的钟响 笑我又唏嘘","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#33261a"},{"title":"沉溺的戏","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/83b49007b4d24d0eb558e3950c440812.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/83b49007b4d24d0eb558e3950c440812.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"爵士","value":"Jazz","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"忧郁","value":"Sentimental/Melancholic/Lonely","is_default":false},"lyric":"我以为我能轻易触碰你\n我真想和你走到时间尽头\n可是啊对你来说 我只是弃之可惜\n这说不清的友情或是爱情 我只能沉溺","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#172f80"},{"title":"坠","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/d35cbfa5a11345e4ac0873c93d9ae970.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/d35cbfa5a11345e4ac0873c93d9ae970.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"电音","value":"Electronic","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"放松","value":"Chill","is_default":false},"lyric":"我把灵魂锁进思念的茧\n放任自己深潜你眸中的海洋\n荒芜的梦中挂满喝醉的星\n摇摇欲坠向你的坐标落下","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#173e82"},{"title":"追","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/4351f5f758614fca9cdf94e2f33caa4e.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/4351f5f758614fca9cdf94e2f33caa4e.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"电音","value":"Electronic","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"活力","value":"Dynamic/Energetic","is_default":false},"lyric":"我透过月亮 看朦胧的未来\n在逐梦的途中歇脚 画幅印象派\n那么忘我啊 连风都听不见\n月光见证我 追在梦的后面","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"女声","value":"Female","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#165d7b"},{"title":"寻音","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/3b70777ad4a4499ba27d53a364554453.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/3b70777ad4a4499ba27d53a364554453.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"电音","value":"Electronic","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"活力","value":"Dynamic/Energetic","is_default":false},"lyric":"在这个潮湿的夜晚风停住不动\n树林也静默 只剩我和你相拥\n就一起到遥远的梦境去找寻\n那回响在灵魂深处的声音","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"女声","value":"Female","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#2b2127"},{"title":"就粉碎我","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/78924630b9db4c929d783d39f97b23b7.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/78924630b9db4c929d783d39f97b23b7.mp3","genre":{"show_name":"朋克","value":"Punk","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"兴奋","value":"Excited","is_default":false},"lyric":"每天早上一杯速溶就随便喝\n再像可怜人一样嘶吼怒骂一下\n夜晚在不属于我的城市喝醉游荡\n被生活粉碎被一切粉碎\n就粉碎我的骄傲\n就粉碎我的愤怒\n就粉碎我的执着\n就粉碎我的热情","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#177b82"},{"title":"樱花树下的秘密","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/71bbf27a385d45c19e5184ee5248ecb0.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/71bbf27a385d45c19e5184ee5248ecb0.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"流行","value":"Pop","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"思念","value":"Nostalgic/Memory","is_default":false},"lyric":"阳光洒落在旧课桌旁 我偷偷看你侧脸的光\n书页间藏着的小心思 和樱花一起悄悄绽放\n小卖部门口故意徘徊 只为和你多一秒遇见\n其实偶尔我也会吃醋 看那女孩与你肩并肩\n听说你喜欢晴天和海 我默默记在心里面\n那些未曾说出口的话 藏在心底成了诗篇\n这粉色秘密微酸又甜 遗憾总让机会擦肩\n但愿未来会有那一天 你能听见我的心弦","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"女声","value":"Female","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#7f421a"},{"title":"江南闲梦","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/6d5b91fcb5dc444bb09643bbafbfeb3f.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/6d5b91fcb5dc444bb09643bbafbfeb3f.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"国风","value":"Chinese Style","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"放松","value":"Chill","is_default":false},"lyric":"小桥流水 轻舟摇曳过柳岸\n烟雨蒙蒙 青瓦白墙映江南\n茶香氤氲 书卷轻翻旧时言\n江南闲梦 悠悠岁月慢慢看\n诗意画卷 花开水乡间\n清风拂面 心事皆释然\n岁月静好 笑谈人世间\n在这江南里 梦回旧时年","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"女声","value":"Female","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#6a662f"},{"title":"局外人","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/d18d8129308c48a0b64e637986dece78.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/d18d8129308c48a0b64e637986dece78.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"民谣","value":"Folk","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"思念","value":"Nostalgic/Memory","is_default":false},"lyric":"走过林立的高楼 喧闹的街道如此空旷\n逆行汹涌的人潮 犹豫着前进的方向\n我在这城市中漂泊 是拼搏还是挣扎\n舞台上的局外人啊 是坚强还是擅长伪装\n我说理想不重 只压弯了月光\n道路过于宽广 难免迷失方向\n我和这城市不熟 只顾得上闯荡\n白天藏好迷茫 夜晚在梦里飘荡","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"女声","value":"Female","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#2b2129"},{"title":"归家","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/912bf1f31b564ca49d1e8298bd93028b.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/912bf1f31b564ca49d1e8298bd93028b.mp3","genre":{"show_name":"民谣","value":"Folk","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"忧郁","value":"Sentimental/Melancholic/Lonely","is_default":false},"lyric":"坐在空空的房间 陪着我的只有吉他\n城市灯火明明灭灭 孤独的人走在长街\n心中的家像远方的月 看得见却触不及边界\n我四处张望 眼眸藏不住失望\n我想有一个家 有小小的沙发和她种的花\n她会抚平我所有伤疤 她会爱我不论冬夏\n心中灯塔忽暗又忽烁 归家梦从未凋落\n异乡霓虹照不亮寂寞 漂泊的心还渴望着落","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#21252b"},{"title":"格桑花的等待","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/ad5a0992bdb44a739c0835e95e0f2f07.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/ad5a0992bdb44a739c0835e95e0f2f07.mp3","genre":{"show_name":"DJ","value":"DJ","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"伤感","value":"Sorrow/Sad","is_default":false},"lyric":"我问你是谁，那心中的爱难猜\n一朵格桑花，她留守在旷野外\n你说爱不在，往事深情成空白\n惊鸿过一瞥，原来寂寞是天籁\n什么样的情欠下何种相思债\n什么样的爱等到下一次花开\n缘尽情难在，还会有什么期待\n相遇即离开，月光洒落秋水外","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#1d407c"},{"title":"丢了月亮","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/45af5cc5cd624afdaed6a4f00975df0b.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/45af5cc5cd624afdaed6a4f00975df0b.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"民谣","value":"Folk","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"忧郁","value":"Sentimental/Melancholic/Lonely","is_default":false},"lyric":"他说想要去流浪，像一匹野马\n在草原奔波辗转，听晚风歌唱\n也许他真能找到，这样的地方\n总好过在城市的角落，孤单流放\n这一生啊，埋藏着太多的遗憾\n渴望光啊，却又被现实打得遍体鳞伤\n这青春啊，到底是年少的轻狂\n月亮它啊，终究抵不过六便士的分量","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#171472"},{"title":"夏日微风的低语","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/87cb1e67a85a456e8ed4e581c0c00d25.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/87cb1e67a85a456e8ed4e581c0c00d25.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"民谣","value":"Folk","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"思念","value":"Nostalgic/Memory","is_default":false},"lyric":"想你像树荫下的微风\n轻轻吹过我心头的夏天\n盼你如晨曦穿过小窗\n一丝丝光芒映在旧墙\n你是我日复一日的期待\n是每条小路上的远方\n在每个普通的时刻里\n你是无尽思念的风光","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"女声","value":"Female","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#17826d"},{"title":"迟到","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/c5259e419f664328b3aa13b1b957704d.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/c5259e419f664328b3aa13b1b957704d.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"流行","value":"Pop","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"放松","value":"Chill","is_default":false},"lyric":"床头放着闹钟 怀里抱着猫\n喂食器一工作 猫就喵喵叫\n可是为什么 我还是睡过头\n难道神明在说 我注定迟到\n相遇迟到相恋迟到 分手也迟到\n追赶不上挽留不了 只剩下苦笑\n我与你的happyend 总是差一点\n如果抵达不了 干脆逃开你的怀抱","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"女声","value":"Female","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#823b17"},{"title":"荆棘尽头","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/1f881f51f6f84a5ebffb563946088f78.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/1f881f51f6f84a5ebffb563946088f78.mp3","genre":{"show_name":"流行","value":"Pop","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"快乐","value":"Happy","is_default":false},"lyric":"多少次满身污泥，多少次人海沉浮\n你从我背后走来，带动温热的晚风\n水雾稀薄了，空气旋转了\n绝望消散了，荡气回肠了\n破除了荆棘，将苦化作了甜蜜\n站在我身后，为累赋格了意义\n星垂低语耳边呢喃\n说千万别再走丢了","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"女声","value":"Female","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#143e6e"},{"title":"空空","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/02d8353ac85a410ea0d65092d1cacce0.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/02d8353ac85a410ea0d65092d1cacce0.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"流行","value":"Pop","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"忧郁","value":"Sentimental/Melancholic/Lonely","is_default":false},"lyric":"关了灯在屋中 心太空\n失去所有联络 没行踪\n模糊的空气里 要发疯\n乌云密布的我 是黑洞\n比一块冰更寂更冷\n比一尾鱼更哑更聋\n沉溺在自我世界 无视情感涌动\n深陷于太空四季 梦境与诗中","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#178282"},{"title":"梦里梦外","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/254041d42b2145b3ab2813657f576a11.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/254041d42b2145b3ab2813657f576a11.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"流行","value":"Pop","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"伤感","value":"Sorrow/Sad","is_default":false},"lyric":"在梦里爱上你\n所有斑驳都重生奕奕\n在梦外离开你 \n爱的忍耐都化为灰燃\n梦中阳光耀眼\n醒来只见黑暗幽远\n走不出望不穿\n爱的语言都成为云烟","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"女声","value":"Female","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#0b1a41"},{"title":"思卿","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/de1f52e6f45a4831b37406f5e986d810.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/de1f52e6f45a4831b37406f5e986d810.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"国风","value":"Chinese Style","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"伤感","value":"Sorrow/Sad","is_default":false},"lyric":"提笔绘，浮生卷卷落画，雕琢我心扉\n叹只叹，此景难入你眼，空留了伤悲\n骤雨催，车马滚滚印辙，装下离人泪\n却思归，自此山高水远，恐是再难回\n且看那风月笑，知是情深不可往\n饮浊酒一杯，在红尘染尽爱恨憔悴\n又闻那落花飞，点了流水尚余味\n此一生，只一生，凭回忆将卿魂牵梦追","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#157676"},{"title":"白瓦","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/11bcc4a586b64e4db92f9abe37cb8756.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/11bcc4a586b64e4db92f9abe37cb8756.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"国风","value":"Chinese Style","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"放松","value":"Chill","is_default":false},"lyric":"轻踏白瓦巷 雨后晴空长\n柳絮沾露珠 釉色染霜凉\n古道旁桃花香 纸伞下人相望\n岁月轻抚过 留下一抹妆\n白瓦映月光 故事在回响\n烟雨水墨里 勾勒过往\n青石板街旁 谁家炊烟扬\n一幕幕画卷 藏匿旧时芳华香","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#605039"},{"title":"一镜千年","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/f94c077bbc9e45c0bae61f59fb558017.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/f94c077bbc9e45c0bae61f59fb558017.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"国风","value":"Chinese Style","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"怀旧","value":"Nostalgic/Memory","is_default":false},"lyric":"铜镜轻拂尘 岁月留痕深\n镜中映出旧时颜 笑语盈盈似花绽\n镜中影似水流年 恍若隔世梦一场\n镜外人诉尽沧桑 昔日风华已成殇\n精雕细琢星云纹 凤鸟欲飞蟠龙腾\n镜里千秋照出历史悠悠\n汉唐宋明时光转 故事长长已泛黄\n你看那谁的手拂过往事幽幽","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#674e32"},{"title":"留学生","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/2057d04e3ec14e50b5a682bfe8ee68a4.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/2057d04e3ec14e50b5a682bfe8ee68a4.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"嘻哈","value":"Hip Hop/Rap","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"鼓舞","value":"Inspirational/Hopeful","is_default":false},"lyric":"打包20刀的一荤一素\n回到尽头那间standard room\n进门先和室友打个招呼\n不是Sam是袋鼠和蜘蛛\n没有尖叫也不会被吓哭\n我早就对此熟视无睹\n比起危险还是essay更痛苦\n我埋头在房间极限赶due\n都说留学必然经历四个阶段\n兴奋焦虑疯癫和麻木感\n陌生的地域，毕业的压力\n连吃饱饭都那么艰难\n在异国看同一轮太阳落下\n其实我也很想家\n还好心态和胃很抗压\n留学生的信念不会轻易崩塌","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#823e17"},{"title":"她的故事","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/e706093d72ad49b4a8300854c59c1d87.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/e706093d72ad49b4a8300854c59c1d87.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"爵士","value":"Jazz","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"放松","value":"Chill","is_default":false},"lyric":"玫瑰会奔向远方 伴着荒郊月亮\n夜莺为她歌唱 南风也为她奔忙\n她会始终绽放 她会给你芳香\n她会一路歌唱 去她自己的乡","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"女声","value":"Female","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#174b80"},{"title":"不眠夜","desc":"","cover":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/bced246d698a4b0f82ecaa7a4c1149cd.png","play_url":"https://lf-flow-web-cdn.doubao.com/obj/flow-doubao/samantha/skills/music/bced246d698a4b0f82ecaa7a4c1149cd.mp4","genre":{"show_name":"朋克","value":"Punk","is_default":false},"mood":{"show_name":"兴奋","value":"Excited","is_default":false},"lyric":"不想听的电话就按掉\n不想见的人就让他走开\n不想装傻就尽情发泄吧\n失败的梦想就让它算了吧\n我要我要我要一个不眠夜\n鼓点敲击我的大脑 吞没我的疯狂\n那个瞬间 我好像看到了天堂。\n哪怕只能暂时逃避 我也只想逃避","video_id":"","gender":{"show_name":"男声","value":"Male","is_default":false},"cover_main_color":"#551e7a"}]}},"deep_search":{"template":{}}}}
